The amulet of power is noticeably more effective for wizards than it is
for other roles; this is because the Eye's base item is now an amulet of
power.  The amulet's regeneration is still less than the Eye's used to
be, though as the character gains level the regen rate will rapidly
approach that of the old Eye.

While it is indeed a powerful addition, it must be worn to be effective,
and I have to note that if you'd been wearing Vlad's life-saving amulet
instead of the Eye, this character might be around today.  ;)

